          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Knight Rider: The Game is a video game developed by Davilex Games based on the original television series of the same name.\nThe game was released in Europe on PlayStation 2 and PC on November 22, 2002 and in North America on the PC on February 12, 2003. The game allows the player to take control of KITT - the Knight Industries Two Thousand, in a range of missions including, racing, exploring, chasing and others. The player will also meet famous villains from the original series, including KARR and Garthe Knight.",
